        "title": "Approve the canon template list",
        "status": "decided",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "body": "Seven become canon templates (plan stays its own), two fold in or retire, eleven are superseded by primitives pages (approved), six are redo-from-scratch or your call, two are approved for removal after the repo template, and a repo template is new. Edit the lists if you disagree, then set this to decided. 30 October: the audit (group 6) checked each one against the library as it is now.",
        "identity": {
