        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## 6. To build (1)\n\nNew: not in the library yet.\n\n| Template | What it is | Used by | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `repo-template` | A starter for a repository: its home graph, who it is for, where to start, and its key destinations | — | Canon has a first-pass `github-repo` class and an older gallery scaffold (`repo-home-template`); this is the template that replaces both. |\n"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
