        "body": "In canon (not yet published): the Collection class, the Collection template (a Detail page that stretches then scrolls, Summary, Glyph, derived by its Method), the contains edge, and the graph-paper environment. A member is a portal the collection contains, or (switched on, github:// only) a graph in its folder; there is no list. The card turns over to its settings with a gear: folder on/off, order, and where the members come from. Pinned, not done: how a collection on the published site reads its folder (a host cannot list one); the portal drawn as a live tile, the member's real glyph and the \"needs you\" dot in tiles; and retiring the old collection template, window controller and workboard.",
